                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Matus to Mr. Guzman.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Translation—Handed to the Secretary of
                        State by the Nicaraguan minister, April 23, 1895, 3 p.m.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-04-23"><hi rendition="#italic">April 23,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Our representative at London cables British Government will not accede to our
                    request. Ultimatum will be notified to-day.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
